id: god-of-peace
name: God of Peace
optionOf: divine-magic
description: Enter the Mindful State until the start of your next turn, when you Power Up.
text: >
  God of Peace [Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Enter the Mindful State until the start of your next turn.

---

# Armed from the Traits tab, as every Triggered effect is: the next Power Up Maneuver sets it off.
[triggered/power, 1/round]
enterState("mindful", 1, "start-of-next-turn");
